{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Dot Die</strong> is a dark, first-person horror puzzle game with a <strong>retro PSX and VHS-inspired aesthetic</strong>, built entirely around <strong>Morse code</strong>. Trapped in a maze of dimly lit corridors, decaying rooms, and claustrophobic vents, you must decode every signal to survive.. because <strong>one mistake might just mean the end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your past has caught up with you. Someone wants you to suffer as they once did.. and they\u2019ve designed a twisted game where <strong>failure is fatal</strong>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/0f98442c5b056415e28533f21c380ffd.poster.avif?t=1770533362\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/0f98442c5b056415e28533f21c380ffd.webm?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Morse Code is Your Lifeline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle, clue, and message revolves around <strong>Morse code</strong>. You\u2019ll interpret light, sound, and timing to progress, and with no room for error, the stakes are life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>in-game cheat sheet</strong> is your only aid. Use it wisely, because <strong>a single mistake could end it al!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/6615709a6641cc9f93170fbb82f3cb97.poster.avif?t=1770533362\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/6615709a6641cc9f93170fbb82f3cb97.webm?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/6615709a6641cc9f93170fbb82f3cb97.mp4?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadly, Mind-Bending Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate eerie, shifting environments that twist reality and challenge your perception. Every puzzle solved pulls you deeper into the captor\u2019s game but also <strong>closer to the reason why you are here</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/ba68911145b04381de98293295ff3184.poster.avif?t=1770533362\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/ba68911145b04381de98293295ff3184.webm?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique horror puzzle gameplay</strong> centered entirely around Morse code</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game reference sheet</strong> for learning and decoding signals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro PSX &amp; VHS-inspired visuals</strong> with static, low-poly textures, and eerie lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One mistake means death</strong>\u00a0 high-stakes gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> driving the horror and puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Signal?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dot, every dash, every sound is <strong>critical</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail once.. and it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen carefully. Decode perfectly. Stay alive.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738450?t=1770533362","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3738450?t=1770533362","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/307e20835e29cc8f7f6838957c5381401009f26a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770533362","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/307e20835e29cc8f7f6838957c5381401009f26a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770533362","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4185000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash Dot Die</strong> is a dark, first-person horror puzzle game with a <strong>retro PSX and VHS-inspired aesthetic</strong>, built entirely around <strong>Morse code</strong>. Trapped in a maze of dimly lit corridors, decaying rooms, and claustrophobic vents, you must decode every signal to survive.. because <strong>one mistake might just mean the end.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your past has caught up with you. Someone wants you to suffer as they once did.. and they\u2019ve designed a twisted game where <strong>failure is fatal</strong>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/0f98442c5b056415e28533f21c380ffd.poster.avif?t=1770533362\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/0f98442c5b056415e28533f21c380ffd.webm?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Morse Code is Your Lifeline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle, clue, and message revolves around <strong>Morse code</strong>. You\u2019ll interpret light, sound, and timing to progress, and with no room for error, the stakes are life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>in-game cheat sheet</strong> is your only aid. Use it wisely, because <strong>a single mistake could end it al!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/6615709a6641cc9f93170fbb82f3cb97.poster.avif?t=1770533362\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/6615709a6641cc9f93170fbb82f3cb97.webm?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/6615709a6641cc9f93170fbb82f3cb97.mp4?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deadly, Mind-Bending Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate eerie, shifting environments that twist reality and challenge your perception. Every puzzle solved pulls you deeper into the captor\u2019s game but also <strong>closer to the reason why you are here</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/ba68911145b04381de98293295ff3184.poster.avif?t=1770533362\" width=1000 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/extras/ba68911145b04381de98293295ff3184.webm?t=1770533362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique horror puzzle gameplay</strong> centered entirely around Morse code</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game reference sheet</strong> for learning and decoding signals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro PSX &amp; VHS-inspired visuals</strong> with static, low-poly textures, and eerie lighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One mistake means death</strong>\u00a0 high-stakes gameplay</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> driving the horror and puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Can You Survive the Signal?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every dot, every dash, every sound is <strong>critical</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fail once.. and it\u2019s over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen carefully. Decode perfectly. Stay alive.</strong></p>","developers":["Iron Interactive Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/aef784f766efac3027efe31d5ceddf5aa708a363/header.jpg?t=1770533362","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3738450/1312413207/6787d3ede5a4036eacc5149abdea855e9c2c5e61/1763746242/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763746812","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3738450/1312413207/6787d3ede5a4036eacc5149abdea855e9c2c5e61/1763746242/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763746812","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3738450/1312413207/6787d3ede5a4036eacc5149abdea855e9c2c5e61/1763746242/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763746812","id":257235965,"name":"Dash Dot Die Game","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst