233482.600x338.jpg?t=1770533362"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/cd32129981cc6cacc23e27ded48bf449211324fa/ss_cd32129981cc6cacc23e27ded48bf449211324fa.1920x1080.jpg?t=1770533362","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738450/cd32129981cc6cacc23e27ded48bf449211324fa/ss_cd32129981cc6cacc23e27ded48bf449211324fa.600x338.jpg?t=1770533362"}],"short_description":"Dash Dot Die is a first-person Morse puzzle game set in a maze of forgotten rooms, hallways, and airducts. Your past has caught up with you. Someone is determined to make you suffer just as they once did. Trapped in their twisted game, you must endure the same fate and overcome every challenge.","steam_appid":3738450,"support_info":{"email":"info@chris3design.nl","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}